1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,330
Imagine waking up one morning, looking outside your window, and the sky is pitch black.

2
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:07,463
The Sun has completely disappeared!

3
00:00:07,463 --> 00:00:08,786
What would happen to Earth?

4
00:00:08,786 --> 00:00:10,306
Would we freeze instantly?

5
00:00:10,306 --> 00:00:11,617
Surprisingly, no.

6
00:00:11,617 --> 00:00:15,281
For the first eight minutes and twenty seconds, we wouldn't even notice.

7
00:00:15,281 --> 00:00:20,012
Sunlight takes that long to travel ninety-three million miles to reach Earth.

8
00:00:20,012 --> 00:00:23,578
For eight minutes, the world would carry on completely normally.

9
00:00:23,578 --> 00:00:25,330
Then, utter darkness.

10
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:27,892
Within days, global temperatures plummet.

11
00:00:27,892 --> 00:00:31,789
Within weeks, the oceans begin to freeze from the surface down.

12
00:00:31,789 --> 00:00:34,142
Could humanity survive without our star?

13
00:00:34,142 --> 00:00:39,019
Only by moving deep underground, powered by geothermal and nuclear energy.

14
00:00:39,019 --> 00:00:43,112
Subscribe to MysteryVerse for more mind-blowing science mysteries!

15
00:00:43,112 --> 00:00:44,264
Stay curious!

